      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "43",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'utamiida gabiikta gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweanean ea ghwaahiinaan dooshta, nea dooshta duukusa meatkweeda ghayeawa gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ng'ula, giigheambiita ASEETA Israeli ghwahidu nea gwaleabu heeda ghayeawa. Ak nyeashtaanyi ghwanyaashta nyeashta beega saang'a, ak gaweeshiit ng'eanyiida aba giigheambiitaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gili siihiimuun gawuurji gidaghayi siihiimu damanda ghayi aahidu dalas uhuuda mujiini, nea gidaghayi siihiimu gawuurji gidaghayi siihiimu aba ghuuteenda Gebari ak ghaabeadi nea ghaabwadi jih ng'eanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa giigheambiita NG'UTAMIIDA jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA, nea gwasik dooshta duukusa heeda ghayeawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gagatgadan guroorooda ak ghwaadan ea ghoahiitanaan doodooda mida gah. Hean ghwanyiit giigheambiita NG'UTAMIIDA jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damandida nea ghamiinaada siida aba murdeedeanyu, hean ghaayiinyi ghuuta siida nea goobaloolan aba jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeeshiinean, “Ea orjeeda siida, nih hoorgeedeanyu gil bea gheambalmeeda, ak ea heeda jea daala gil aba geeshangeasu, aba damanda jea deabiideawa bugusta fuga Israeli damanda manda muudeanooda. Nea fuga Israeli ea maygut ghang'uda ririnnyeanda gheawungeasu ghaydidi, saawa ghana sugoodiga nyaawa, aba ng'asheega nyaawa bea hiseadayeanduumeeda, ghana aba muscheeka sugoodiga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saawa ghwayiin mughoonyeanda nyaawa murdeeda gidingeandeanyu, ea huwanga nyaawa, murdeeda huwangeasu. Nea abeeda gwanda ghamarda gabeachi dageascheedeanyu ea saawa, ak saawa ea ning'uda ririnnyeanda gheawungeasu ghaydidi aba ng'asheega nyaawa munyas sin, asi naalaschi iheenga nyaawa aba nyarasteanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi saawa danung'waada ng'asheega nyaawa bea hiseadayeanduumeeda, ea muscheeka sugoodiga nyaawa, ak ea deasheagiideawanean ak gaydeabiida bugusta nyaawa damanda manda muudeanooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak ang'iing'i siida, ahiimsiina fuga Israeli gheawi sibata ASEETEAN, ak ghwanal giduurji, abeeda gayghabwaspwas aba ng'asheega nyaawa munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama inyas ghabwaspwas aba sinaweega nyaawa sean munyas, abeeda giihiimsi gidasideasta gheeda sibata ASEETA, ea giduurji ea gidaghuudajeagaaschi ea gidasideasta sean. Ak ginung' ghwanal saawa sean, ea hamurajeagaaschi ea deaweedajeagaaschi sean, ak ging'oorsi madeeda nyaawa ak ghoang'waay gidasideasta sean ea deaweedajeagaaschi sean ea hamurajeagaaschi sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih deaweedeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA, ng'eanyiida sean neaweesa uhuuda giijeeda gajea ghaydit muuchi. Aba gideaba ng'ula nih deaweedeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA gil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Heeda wagiida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak nih ea gichea eeteenda heeda wagiida gil aba geatinga. (Geatinda gaba geatinda ea geawunda geatinda); hoorgeadaanyi gaba geatinagi ak baraknataanyi gaba geatinagi, ak murdajeagaaschi ea gwariiksa gidaghuuta meadajeega sean geatinagi gil ak nih gayghoah hoorgeeda wagiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eada ng'eanyi was badayda ng'eanyiida ea ghwahita hoorgeedeaba ng'eanyi geatin iyeenya gil. Ak hawundaanyi ea geatinagi gil, ghang'eada hoorgeeda mwanang' ea ghwahita hoorgeeda haw geatin ang'wan gil ak baraknataanyi ea geatinagi gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak heeda wagiida bea humng'eeda gajea geatin ang'wan gil, nea heeda wagiida sigwariisa beasta ak gagal humng'eeda gajea gujaw iyeenya gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea hooweani siyeeta beastean geawundaanyi geatin damaniyeenya gil, ak baraknataanyi ea geatin damaniyeenya gil, ak gooyang'deay murdajeega sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak neaneacheeda geawundaanyi geatin damanang'wan gil, ak hawundaanyi ea geatin damanang'wan gil, meadajeagaaschi asang'wan, ak murdajeagaaschi geatinda googweena iyeenya, nea hoorgeadaanyi ea geatinagi gil meadajeega sean. Ak gidingeayoojigaaschi bea heeda wagiida gaygagal meatkweeda ghayeawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giighaydita heeda wagiida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeeshiinean, “Ea orjeeda siida, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, suh hamurajeega heeda wagiida gil. Jea eesin aba damandida iisiitayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda aba badaydida, ak geetalealsa foojeanda badaydaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashoohoodiga bea dooshta Lawiin was jeata Sadoki, gea jea gwaneekiisean gil ak ghwahit ak gagadiyeesean gearugu aniini NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA. Ak gajadawa jurukuta mwanang' ghoah haleanjeeda sisapa geadi aba riing'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygeani foojeandaanyi mwaatkwa, ak giyiini uhuuda gujakaaschi asang'wan ea meadajeega sean asang'wan bea neaneacheeda, ea meadajeagaaschi sean, ak nih gichea amiitaayda gil ak gisini giirooroocheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaygeani gicha jurukutida bea haleanjeeda sisapa geadi aba riing'eedean ak gaygwardeaysiina heeda sirugu bea gheeda sibata ASEETA was jarooda bea heeda ghaydit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eaweedeaba iyeenya gaygeani ghwarayda manda sirjeeda, ghoah haleanjeeda sisapa geadi aba riing'eeda. Ak gajeepuus heeda wagiida gawuurji gidasiipuusta heeda jurukuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata giimiinnooda abeeda gajadayda jurukuta mwanang' manda sirjeeda ea laghweenda leabu jeeda hawanda, nea manda sirjeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeani gwaneekiisa madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gaygoohiisa ashoohoodiga badayda nyaawa balang'da, ak gajeatayda saawa ghoah haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda bea NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak galeaga sean ea ghwahita eawooji ispwa gajadayda ghwarayda, ea jurukuta mwanang' ea lagweenda leabu jeeda hawanda nea manda sirjeeda, ghoah haleanjeeda sisapa geadi aba riing'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
