              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama inyas goosha eawoojisu as ispwaan, abeeda eaweedeaba sis ashoohoocheanda gayghoadayda haleanjeedeang'wa sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda aba heeda wagiida, ea haleanjeedeang'wa sisapa geadi bea hoyyoo, ak abeeda gaydamwaseagwa gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.”",
          "type": "text",
